```{=html}
<ol class="postlist">
<% for (const item of items) { %>
<li class="post-item" <%= metadataAttrs(item) %>>
<span class="post-date"><%- item.date %></span>
<div>
<h3 class="post-title"><a href="<%- item.path %>"><%- item.title %></a></h3>
<% if (item.description) { %><p class="post-dek"><%= item.description %></p><% } %>
<p class="post-meta"><%- (item.categories || []).slice(0, 2).join(' · ') %><% if (item['reading-time']) { %> · <%- item['reading-time'] %> read<% } %></p>
</div>
</li>
<% } %>
</ol>
```
